Copyright (c) 2026 Roy Harden

Original TypeScript implementation. No third-party repository source was vendored.

Design and evaluation ideas were informed by:
- petehottelet/spreadsheet-auditor (MIT): deterministic findings, bounded review and planted-defect matching.
- Keremozdemirra/xlsx-review (MIT): R1C1 neighbour agreement and direct OOXML inspection.
- BayramAnnakov/excel-hygiene (Apache-2.0): rules-first review and planted spreadsheet mistakes.
- TypeSafe documentation: typed Choice judgments and confidence-based routing. No cookbook source copied.

These are idea references, not executed competitor benchmarks or endorsements. Installed dependencies retain their own licenses; review their exact versions and notices during activation.

Synthetic workbook source is included under this repository's MIT license. EUSES/Enron derivatives have undocumented or uncertain underlying dataset licenses; SpreadsheetBench has separate share-alike terms. Such corpora are optional local-only research and are not included. GPL/EUPL projects were not vendored or made dependencies.
